''' Furax Incarnon Genesis''' is an item that is used to add [[Incarnon]] upgrades to the {{Weapon|Furax}}, {{Weapon|Furax Wraith}}, or {{Weapon|Mk1-Furax}}.

==Acquisition==
*Upon completion of [[The Duviri Paradox]] and [[Angels of the Zariman]], and unlocking [[The Steel Path]], players can earn {{Resource|Furax Incarnon Genesis}} from [[The Circuit]]'s Steel Path to place on their Furax with the help of [[Cavalero]] in the [[Chrysalith]]. This [[Incarnon Genesis]] form grants it evolutions to a transformation and newfound strength.
*Purchased from Cavalero for {{pc|120}}, complete with the resources used in its installation. This purchase can only be made '''once'''.

==Incarnon Genesis==

===Evolutions===
*Installing the Furax Incarnon Genesis requires 20 {{Resource|Pathos Clamp|Pathos Clamps}}, 70 {{Resource|Dracroot}}, and 300 {{Resource|Ariette Scale|Ariette Scales}}.
*When installed, the first Evolution tier is unlocked. The following Evolution tiers, their requirements for unlocking them, and their related perks, are shown below;
**Each challenge additionally grants '''5,000''' [[affinity]] to the weapon, affected by [[Affinity Booster]]s.

====Evolution I====
*Reach '''6x''' Combo and then [[Melee#Heavy Attack|Heavy Attack]] to activate Incarnon Form.
*Incarnon Form gains Heavy Slam Efficiency and leaves behind {{D|Heat}} Damage fields after Heavy Slams.
**Heavy Slams receive '''90%''' [[Melee Combo#Heavy Attack Efficiency|Heavy Attack Efficiency]].
**Field does '''50''' {{D|Heat}} damage every second for '''7''' seconds.
**Field has '''0%''' Critical Chance, '''1x''' Critical Damage, '''5m''' range and '''50%''' Status Chance. 
***Status Chance is not affected by the '''Absolute Dominion''' evolution or mods.
***Field damage is affected by elemental mods, melee damage mods, and faction mods.
***Field damage is <u>not</u> affected by [[Melee Combo#Combo Multiplier|combo multiplier]].
***Field's radius is <u>not</u> affected by range mods such as {{M|Reach}} or the '''Moonrise Velocity''' evolution.
***Field can trigger and benefit from {{Arcane|Melee Influence}}.
**'''+100%''' Melee Damage
**'''+25%''' Sprint Speed
**'''+25%''' to Bullet Jump
*Incarnon Form lasts for '''180''' seconds and persists until [[death]].

====Evolution II====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Complete a solo mission with this weapon equipped. 
*Perk 1: '''Swordsman's Flourish:'''
**Increase Damage by '''+110''' (Furax) / '''+100''' (Mk1) / '''+65''' (Wraith).
**With Melee Weapon Equipped: '''+100%''' Combo Count Chance
***Does '''not''' apply to quickswap melee. Requires manually equipping the melee, either by holding the weapon swap key (default {{Keybind|F}}) or going into a mission with only the melee weapon equipped.
* Perk 2: '''Kill Joy:''' 
**Increase Damage by '''+90''' (Furax) / '''+80''' (Mk1) / '''+55''' (Wraith).
**'''+10%''' Attack Speed per enemy within '''6m''', stacks up to '''5x'''.

====Evolution III====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Activate this weapon's Incarnon Form '''6''' times in a mission.  
*Perk 1: '''Moonrise Velocity:'''  
**'''+1''' Range
*Perk 2: '''Overhand:'''
**Heavy Attack Efficiency set at '''20%'''
*Perk 3: '''Standoff:'''
**Combo Timer pauses when weapon is [[holster]]ed.

====Evolution IV====
''Unlock Challenge:'' Kill '''30''' enemies affected by {{D|Lifted}} Status.
*Perk 1: '''Flashing Bleed:'''
**'''+40%''' chance of {{D|Slash|Bleed}} on {{D|Impact}} Status Effect
*Perk 2: '''Kinetic Killer:'''
**Increase Critical Damage Multiplier to '''4x''' on Slide Attacks.
*Perk 3: '''Absolute Dominion:'''
**Increase Status Chance by '''+24%''' (Furax) / '''+22%''' (Mk1) / '''+14%''' (Wraith)

==Tips==
*Using {{WF|Titania}}'s {{A|Razorwing}} deactivates the incarnon form of melee weapons, helping you unlock Evolution III quicker.

==Known Bugs==
*Heavy Slams don't receive the '''90%''' Heavy Attack Efficiency in the [[Undercroft]].
*Evolution I: '''+100%''' Melee Damage as well as Evolution IV: Absolute Dominion affect pseudo-exalted weapons such as {{A|Landslide}}, {{A|Slash Dash}}, {{A|Shattered Lash}} and {{A|Whipclaw}}.
**{{A|Blade Storm}} is unaffected.

